@format 1
@id ui-event.22f83f488b461c9c
@title Crop ratio preset — selection changed
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Edit
@event-ref cs|PPanels/PInspectorCropUi.cs|PInspectorRatioPresetBuild|pPresetCombo|SelectionChanged|1
@entry input
@summary Show Custom ratio entry or apply the selected fixed preset as the largest centered even Crop inside the available bounds.
@tag selection changed
@tag PInspector
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector

[input] Ratio preset selected <input>
- Receive the selection changed event from the Crop ratio preset combo @ owner.PInspectorRatioPresetBuild
> route

[route] Apply preset behavior <process>
- Ignore suppressed selection changes and show manual fields when Custom is selected @ owner.PInspectorRatioPresetHandle
- Read the current Crop bounds, or the full rotated frame when no edges have been removed @ owner.PInspectorRatioPresetHandle
- Fit the largest centered rectangle with exact ratio, even dimensions, and even offsets inside those bounds @ owner.PInspectorRatioFit
- Update the ratio, fixed-ratio state, and four Crop edges under event suppression @ owner.PInspectorRatioPresetHandle
- Publish one ratio change and one Crop change, then refresh notices and resulting resolution @ owner.PInspectorRatioPresetHandle
> output

[output] Preset selection complete <output>
= Custom leaves manual ratio editing available without drawing a new Crop.
= A fixed preset draws a centered Crop without expanding beyond an existing Crop.
! Code binding: cs|PPanels/PInspectorCropUi.cs|PInspectorRatioPresetBuild|pPresetCombo|SelectionChanged|1
